{"path":"memory/allocator/destroy","title":"std::allocator<T>::destroy","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::allocator&lt;T&gt;::</span>destroy","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/allocator/destroy","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Calls the destructor of the object pointed to by p.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/memory\">&lt;memory&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev\">\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> destroy<span class=\"br0\">(</span> pointer p <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> U <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> destroy<span class=\"br0\">(</span> U<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> p <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark\">(deprecated in C++17)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(removed in C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Calls the destructor of the object pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>~T<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>~U<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> p\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the object that is going to be destroyed\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue400\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 400</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code> was cast to <code>T*</code>, which is the type of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code>\n</td>\n<td>removed the redundant cast\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/allocator_traits/destroy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>destroy</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destructs an object stored in the allocated storage <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path":"memory/allocator","title":"std::allocator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::allocator<T>::destroy","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: until C++11, since C++11, until C++20. Calls the destructor of the object pointed to by p."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"p"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"destroy","note":"destructs an object stored in the allocated storage"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":115,"codeBlockCount":0}
